WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.199 --> 00:00:09.110
When contemplating the meaning of life, it
is easy to become confused and disheartened

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:15.940
as we find that there is no conclusive overarching
meaning that we can hold on to.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:22.020
When it comes to trying to find some grand
purpose that humanity is serving to, we can

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.410
only really answer questions with more questions.

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:32.910
And every question we ask seems to only widen
the scope of our perspective of the universe

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:38.140
and consequently reduce the significance of
our existence.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:43.500
For every step we take away from our self
in order to get a better view of what’s

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.070
around us, we become smaller and smaller.

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:50.160
So what do we do?

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.190
How can we find meaning and purpose in our
life if we can’t understand or define our

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:59.560
purpose outside of it?

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:05.880
In the scope of the boundless and perpetual
universe, our individual lives are fundamentally

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:07.729
meaningless.

00:01:07.729 --> 00:01:12.810
But that does not imply that they can’t
still be filled with meaning.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:19.380
As humans, through the power of imagination
and higher consciousness, we have the incredible

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:24.280
ability to create meaning within the meaningless.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:31.109
We are creators, able to imagine meaning and
attach it to the things around us.

00:01:31.109 --> 00:01:39.439
We can create and carry out concepts like
love, morality, and success.

00:01:39.439 --> 00:01:47.369
We can create narratives out of our lives
and experience wonder and inspiration.

00:01:47.369 --> 00:01:53.200
We are all like children playing games of
imagination with the world.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:58.479
And it is through this concept that we can
uncover life’s meaning.

00:01:58.479 --> 00:02:03.409
The meaning of human life is simply to create
meaning.

00:02:03.409 --> 00:02:08.849
To play and enjoy the game of imagination
as best we can.

00:02:08.849 --> 00:02:16.810
To accept that we do not understand our overarching
purpose and that we may not even have on.

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:23.519
And instead, work to connect with and enjoy
the life we can create around us.

00:02:23.519 --> 00:02:27.000
The relationships and friendships that we
form.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.349
The passions that we follow.

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:33.129
The values and outlooks that we behold.

00:02:33.129 --> 00:02:38.420
These types of things are the true meaning
of human life.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:44.400
We should appreciate our life, not because
there is some grand purpose or meaning behind

00:02:44.400 --> 00:03:14.849
it, but because there is endless meaning that
we can create and enjoy within it.

